  "body": "### 🌟 Codename: *Signal & Polish*\n\n🧭 **`6 PRs` · `3 contributors` · `5 days`** — **The details stop getting in your way.** First runs keep their stability story together, while campaign cards stay all card — not card plus awkward dark corners. 🚀\n\n## 🔥 Highlights\n\n- ✨ **Campaign cards that keep their shape.** A rounded campaign card should feel like one considered surface, not a rectangle peeking through at the corners. In dark themes, the surrounding touchpoint host now stays transparent so the card is all you see. (#9054) Thanks @heggria.\n\n> 📥 **Download:** Tag `open-design-v0.27.0`.\n>\n> | Platform | Architecture | Assets |\n> |---|---|---|\n> | macOS | Apple silicon | [DMG](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-mac-arm64.dmg) · [SHA-256](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-mac-arm64.dmg.sha256) |\n> | macOS | Intel | [DMG](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-mac-x64.dmg) · [SHA-256](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-mac-x64.dmg.sha256) |\n> | Windows | x64 | [Installer](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-win-x64-setup.exe) · [SHA-256](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases/download/open-design-v0.27.0/open-design-0.27.0-win-x64-setup.exe.sha256) |\n\n## 🔁 Changed\n\n- 🧭 **A first session now tells one story.** On a fresh install, Open Design keeps its stability signals with the installation that created them, making the early moments of a run easier to understand without splitting them across anonymous identities. (#8991) Thanks @heggria.\n\n## 🙏 Thanks to everyone who shipped 0.27.0\n\n@mrcfps · @heggria · @lefarcen\n",
